<sub-section | Qualitative observations>
Sub-section content.
</code>

<minipage #mp:l1-section-3>
<section | Results>
Results paragraph.

<sub-section | Quantitative analysis>
Sub-section content.

<sub-section | Qualitative observations>
Sub-section content.
</minipage>

</section>

